div><div><font color=\"#666600\">GET(&quot;<a href=\"http://www.cwb.gov.tw\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.cwb.gov.tw&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237907887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02wMXj7snQ0OPvIYEz4zHP\">http://www.cwb.gov.tw</a>&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">GET(&quot;<a href=\"http://www444.dgbas.gov.tw\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www444.dgbas.gov.tw&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237907887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1z2Qks92NoGfaDojCxXpxR\">http://www444.dgbas.gov.tw</a>&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">x &lt;- GET(&quot;<a href=\"http://www.mohw.gov.tw\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.mohw.gov.tw&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237907887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw06hLp6G4mz8p5386I6kplA\">http://www.mohw.gov.tw</a>&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"># str(x) # length=10</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">x$url # 讀取response url</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">tryCatch(GET(&quot;<a href=\"http://www444.dgbas.gov.tw\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www444.dgbas.gov.tw&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237907887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1z2Qks92NoGfaDojCxXpxR\">http://www444.dgbas.gov.tw</a>&quot;),</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">         error = function(e) {</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">           print(&quot;ERROR&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">           })</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">tryCatch(GET(&quot;<a href=\"http://www.mohw.gov.tw\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.mohw.gov.tw&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237907887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw06hLp6G4mz8p5386I6kplA\">http://www.mohw.gov.tw</a>&quot;),</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">         error = function(e) {</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">           print(&quot;ERROR&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">           })</font></div><div># end</div></div></code></div><br><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Wh7EvTVwU30/V_-s-YVrwQI/AAAAAAAAKyg/gQ3qD6sRpS4TBHGDKp34JKoMnrU19-jvACLcB/s1600/url_check.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Wh7EvTVwU30/V_-s-YVrwQI/AAAAAAAAKyg/gQ3qD6sRpS4TBHGDKp34JKoMnrU19-jvACLcB/s1600/url_check.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237907887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2r5ZfuFQTmg6zbyqV2dfqw\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Wh7EvTVwU30/V_-s-YVrwQI/AAAAAAAAKyg/gQ3qD6sRpS4TBHGDKp34JKoMnrU19-jvACLcB/s400/url_check.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"295\" height=\"400\"></a></p><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></span></div><br>Hen-Chao Chang於 2016年10月13日星期四 UTC+8上午10時24分57秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><font face=\"mingliu, monospace\" size=\"4\">我用 R 進行網址失聯檢測已經一陣子，本來都正常。</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><font face=\"mingliu, monospace\" size=\"4\">但今天檢測衛福部網址「</font><span style=\"font-family:mingliu,monospace;font-size:large\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">url.exists(&quot;<a href=\"http://www.mohw.gov.tw/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.mohw.gov.tw/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237907887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1wwUqL_6Hjaifz4buX8-Yp\">http://www.mohw.gov.tw</a>&quot;)<